{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":1,"title":"외치기","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>를 <b>모두 대문자</b>로 바꾸고 끝에 <code>\"!\"</code>를 붙여 돌려주는 <code>shout(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def shout(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def shout(s):\n    return s.upper() + \"!\"\n","hint":"<p><code>s.upper()</code> 는 대문자로 바꾼 새 문자열을 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"shout(\"hi\")","expected":"HI!","visible":true},{"call":"shout(\"Hello World\")","expected":"HELLO WORLD!","visible":true},{"call":"shout(\"\")","expected":"!","visible":false},{"call":"shout(\"abc1\")","expected":"ABC1!","visible":false}],"id":"py-040"}